    (comment 1 "uPD70337L-8-xxx / PLCC84 socket / 5 V / DMA and bus arbitration")) 
  (text "HOST REQUIREMENTS\n5V_SELECT is directly grounded; 3V3_SELECT is floating.\nDrive valid inputs before DUT power-on; RESET is active LOW.\nX1 and X2 require complementary phases of the same clock.\nGPIO ports switch in compatible groups; see bank-modes.md.\nReserved-pin resistors follow NEC 4G-2; no bank-input pulls.\nSuffix xxx is the unknown factory opcode translation-table code." 
